Description: Shareable Biome configuration rules for ultra-fast Rust-based linting and formatting
 @sebastienrousseau/biome-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
